d food stick forming a white layer.\nDangers of Dehydration\nDehydration poses a threat to the quality of life; it can also result in fatality. Few complications associated are:\nThe human body needs electrolytes, which it gets from water or other fluids to function because they carry electrical impulses from one cell to another. The imbalance due dehydration leads to a seizure attack.\nUTI and Kidney Issues\nOne of the reasons for the minerals calcifying into a stone is the lack of water in the body. Chronic dehydration contributes to urinary tract infection and other related problems like the formation of kidney stones.\nLow Blood Volume – Hypovolemic Shock\nLow water level is related to low blood volume, which subsequently decreases blood pressure. Low BP makes the oxygen level go down, resulting in a fatality.\nWater and electrolyte balance is important for the maintenance of health during exercise. If you don’t drink enough and lose more through sweat, there is a risk of the body going into heat stroke.\nHydration is the key to a healthy body and mind. We live in testing times, taking care of the body has become increasingly difficult. Amidst that, adequate hydration can help maintain both mental and physical wellbeing.\nThe human body has its own way of indicating things going wrong; observe and conquer. If you feel that hydration is not working for the thick white coat on your tong","tokens":["Our"," tongue"," is"," one"," of"," the"," most"," important"," organs"," of"," the"," body","."," It"," is"," responsible"," for"," handling"," one"," of"," the"," five"," senses",","," taste","."," However",","," if"," we"," go"," deeper",","," it"," does"," more"," than"," that","."," The"," tongue"," works"," as"," a"," natural"," cleaning"," agent"," of"," the"," mouth"," and"," serves"," as"," an"," overall"," health"," indicator","."," Your"," tongue"," changes"," its"," color"," and"," texture"," whenever"," something"," is"," going"," wrong"," in"," the"," body